PUZZLE DATA
================================================================================

Lichess puzzle database
    https://database.lichess.org/#puzzles
    CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)

    The shipped corpus (app/assets/puzzles/puzzles.sqlite) is derived from the
    open Lichess puzzle database. Puzzles are filtered, scored and stratified
    by the pipeline in pipeline/; the puzzle positions and solution lines
    originate with Lichess and its contributors.

    CC0 imposes no attribution requirement. It is recorded here because the
    work deserves credit regardless.


